     "titulo": "〜や いなや: as soon as",
     "texto": [
      "To say something happens just at the moment another thing happens: dictionary-form verb + **や いなや**: **つく や いなや、 ねて しまいました** (as soon as I arrived, I fell asleep).",
      "It's more formal than **〜た とたん**."
     ],
